<section class="addon-faq" id="faq">
	<div class="faq-head"><b>FAQ — No Pitch, Just Answers</b><h2>Questions We Get Before Growth Audit.</h2><p>We answer the objections now, and focus on your scaling!</p></div>
	<div class="faq-list">
		<div class="faq-item open"><button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">How fast do you deliver? <span class="icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Audit in <b>24hrs</b>. Logo in 2-3 days. Website in 7-14 days. Ads setup in 48hrs. We ship fast, human-first, no templates that look like everyone.</div></div></div>
		<div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">What if I already have a logo / website? <span class="icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">We audit what you have. We find 3 leaks costing you money — conversion, trust, speed. You keep what works, we fix what leaks.</div></div></div>
		<div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">Do you work with small budgets? <span class="icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Yes. We start from <b>$12 logo design</b>. Marketing packages from KES 15k. You pay for revenue, not vanity metrics.</div></div></div>
		<div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">How do you charge — one time or monthly? <span class="icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Logos & websites are one-time. Ads & social are monthly. No lock-in. You stay because ROAS goes up, not because of contract.</div></div></div>
		<div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">Will I own everything after payment? <span class="icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">100%. Full source files, fonts, colors, logins. We handover everything. No hidden fees.</div></div></div>
		<div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">Why haveit design and not another agency? <span class="icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">We turn clicks into customers. <b>312% avg ROAS</b>, 4.9/5 from 200+ reviews, 100+ brands scaled. Performance-driven, because you are our priority.</div></div></div>
