<div class="cta" id="contact-final">
	<div><h2><span>Ready to Turn Clicks</span><span>Into Customers?</span></h2><p>Growth audit in 24hrs. 3 leaks costing you money — no pitch.</p></div>
	<div class="form">
		<div><input id="cName" placeholder="Your Name" /><div id="nameErr" class="error-msg">Please enter your name</div></div>
		<div><input id="cPhone" placeholder="Your Number" inputmode="tel" /><div id="phoneErr" class="error-msg">Please enter your phone number</div></div>
